+// and the investigator course can move from patrol to the criminal police (role `detective`). The
+// officer no longer takes patrol calls: the shift is spent on a case file — burglary series, car thefts,
+// a phone-fraud organiser, an assault in the park, arson of bins. Each case is built step by step:
